  "query_preview": "/Sunday through Thursday/...\nMonday looks sunny and warmer as the second upper trough moves\nout, but Tuesday looks windy and slightly cooler again as the \nnext broad but shallow Pacific upper trough comes inland. Models\nare in wide disagreement after that with GFS steadily deepening\nthe upper trough which would bring further cooling, while ECMWF\nmoves the trough out which would bring warming. Our decision, \nbased on NBM, is for gradual warming to normal while staying dry\nWednesday through Friday.",
